"The sun. He uncovered the women's deceit and chases Kre without ever reaching her. He rises to the sky and falls wrapped in fire; his suns chase you.","La luna, con la cara quemada. Dirigía el Hain de las mujeres. Corre de golpe, tira medialunas que te siguen y cae del cielo sobre tu sombra.","The moon, with her burned face. She led the women's Hain. She suddenly dashes, throws crescents that follow you and falls from the sky onto your shadow.","Aldeanos","Villagers","Llegó el invierno","Winter has come",
"Llegó la primavera","Spring has come","Llegó el verano","Summer has come","Llegó el otoño","Autumn has come","Florecen los bosques, la estepa y el turbal.","The forests, the steppe and the bog are in bloom.","Las copas se vuelven naranjas.","The treetops turn orange.","Invierno","Winter","Primavera","Spring","Verano","Summer","Otoño","Autumn","invierno","winter","primavera","spring","verano","summer","otoño","autumn","Pasa a la estación siguiente - invierno, primavera, verano y otoño. Ahora - ",
"Moves to the next season - winter, spring, summer and autumn. Now - ","Adelantar la hora","Advance the time","Cambiar la estación","Change the season","Adelanta tres horas (un octavo del día). Para ver el amanecer, el día, el atardecer y la noche.","Advances three hours (an eighth of the day). To see dawn, day, dusk and night.","Cambia entre el frío (un cuarto de luz) y el calor (tres cuartos).","Switches between cold (a quarter of daylight) and warm (three quarters).","Llegó el frío","The cold has come",
"Llegó el calor","The warmth has come","Las noches son largas. Kre camina por el Bosque Rojo.","Nights are long. Kre walks the Red Forest.","Los días son largos. Kreen camina por el Bosque Rojo.","Days are long. Kreen walks the Red Forest.","Frío","Cold","Calor","Warm","frío","cold","calor","warm","Día ","Day ","Lágrima de Tanu","Tanu's Tear","Daño de agua","Water damage","Agua","Water",". Desde ",". From ","Daño de ","Damage of ","% y más cosas del lugar","% and more local finds","veneno","poison",
"hielo","ice","agua","water","fuego","fire","La aldea se mudó","The village moved","Ahora viven en ","Now they live in ","Se acabaron los recursos del lugar.","The land has run out of resources.","¿Adónde se muda la aldea?","Where will the village move?","Tus partidas empiezan acá","Your runs start here","Flechas elegir - E mudarse","Arrows choose - E move","Árboles viejos y noches largas.","Old trees and long nights.","Nieve, piedra y guanacos.","Snow, stone and guanacos.","El mar, las mareas y la luna.",
"The sea, the tides and the moon.","Turba blanda, niebla y barba de viejo.","Soft peat, fog and old man's beard.","Pasto seco y un sol que quema.","Dry grass and a burning sun.","Leñadora","Woodcutter","Cazador de guanacos","Guanaco hunter","Mariscadora","Shellfish gatherer","Juntador de turba","Peat gatherer","Rastreador","Tracker","Soy de acá, de ","I'm from here, from ","Soy Gaki. Ando de lugar en lugar, como la caravana. Ahora paro en ","I'm Gaki. I go from place to place, like the caravan. Now I'm staying at ",
". Conozco este lugar como a mis manos.",". I know this place like the back of my hand.","Todavía estoy acomodando mis cosas. |Pronto voy a tener algo para vos|.","I'm still settling in. |Soon I'll have something for you|."," - Día "," - Day ",". La aldea vive en ",". The village lives in ","Bosque Oscuro","Dark Forest","Estepa","Steppe","Jimbo","Jimbo","Montaña","Mountain","Costa","Coast","Turbal","Peat Bog","Bosque Rojo","Red Forest","Choique","Rhea","El ñandú de la estepa. Escarba el piso y sale corriendo en línea recta hasta la pared. Después se queda quieto, cansado.",
"The rhea of the steppe. It scratches the ground and runs in a straight line until it hits a wall. Then it stands still, tired.","Mata ardiente","Burning Shrub","Una mata seca que el sol de la estepa prendió fuego. Rueda rebotando y deja fuego por donde pasa.","A dry shrub set ablaze by the steppe sun. It rolls and bounces, leaving fire wherever it goes.","Hondero","Slinger","Cazador enmascarado de la estepa. Revolea la honda y la piedra cae en curva donde estabas: mirá la marca en el piso.","A masked hunter of the steppe. He whirls his sling and the stone arcs down where you were: watch the mark on the ground.",
"Sapo del turbal","Bog Toad","Salta entre los pozos de turba. Al caer, larga burbujas de veneno que avanzan despacio.","It jumps between the peat pools. When it lands, it releases slow poison bubbles.","Jejenes","Gnats","Nubes de mosquitos del turbal. Uno no es nada. Vienen de a muchos, en zigzag.","Clouds of bog gnats. One is nothing. They come in swarms, zigzagging.","Murciélago de hielo","Ice Bat","Duerme colgado del techo de la cueva de Jimbo. Aguanta más que el del bosque y, si te toca, te congela.",
"It sleeps hanging from the roof of Jimbo Cave. Tougher than the forest one, and if it touches you, it freezes you.","Bola de hielo","Ice Ball","Un pedazo de glaciar que rueda solo. Al chocar con la pared se le desprenden astillas de hielo.","A chunk of glacier that rolls on its own. When it hits a wall, ice shards break off it.","Llegá al segundo mundo","Reach the second world","Llegá al tercer mundo","Reach the third world","Vencé 3 veces a Ulen","Defeat Ulen 3 times","Pero el Hain no terminó. ",
"But the Hain is not over. "," te espera."," awaits you.","Bioma - ","Biome - ",". E te lleva a su primer piso, en el lugar de su par.",". E takes you to its first floor, in its pair's place.","Xo'on","Xo'on","Volviste del bosque con cosas que tienen espíritu. Animales, piedras, plumas, fuego.","You came back from the forest with things that have spirit. Animals, stones, feathers, fire.","Tiralas |todas| a este fuego. Según lo que quemes, un dios te va a prestar su fuerza.","Throw |all| of them into this fire. Depending on what you burn, a god will lend you their strength.",
"Una sola magia, por una sola partida. Se lanza con |Q| y se carga peleando.","A single magic, for a single run. Cast it with |Q| and charge it by fighting.","Si caés, Cenuke se queda con la mitad de lo que traigas. Si volvés entero, todo vuelve al fuego.","If you fall, Cenuke keeps half of what you carry. If you come back whole, everything goes back to the fire.","El fuego ya habló. Llevás |","The fire has spoken. You carry |","|. Andá al bosque.","|. Go to the forest.","una magia","a magic","No traés nada para el fuego. Los dioses escuchan igual... pero poco.",
