"Otra vez nos vemos, pequeño guerrero.","We meet again, little warrior.","El bosque te venció hoy. Mañana será distinto.","The forest beat you today. Tomorrow will be different.","Tu prueba no terminó. Todavía no.","Your trial isn't over. Not yet.","Cada caída te enseña algo. Escuchá a tu espíritu.","Every fall teaches you something. Listen to your spirit.","Los espíritus se rieron de vos. Que se rían. Volvés.","The spirits laughed at you. Let them laugh. You're coming back.","Por ser tu primera caída, |te regalo cinco plumas más|.",
